# realesr-general-x4v3 (SRVGGNetCompact 64 features, 32 body convs, prelu), weights by xintao / real-esrgan project,
# https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN release v0.2.5.0, bsd 3-clause licence. rewritten for this format, no retraining:
# gray input (first conv summed over r, g, b), each 64-feature conv as four 32-feature layers, the 4x rgb output
# folded to luma and averaged to the source size (1:1). the original pads with zeros, here edges repeat: the outer ~34 px differ.
# far too big to run live: a still-picture switch. 132 layers, about 1.2 million weights.
meyra-net 1
name realesr-general-x4v3 (still only, very slow)
